oad the PDF</a>. </p> </object> <p class="pdf-links"> <a href="/assets/pdf/Poster_CompositionalPaths_SergioQuiroga-1.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open in new tab</a> · <a href="/assets/pdf/Poster_CompositionalPaths_SergioQuiroga-1.pdf" download="">Download PDF</a> </p> </div> <p><a href="https://community.wolfram.com/groups/-/m/t/3210556">See the related Wolfram Community post: Compositional paths on hypergraphs</a></p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="mathematics"/><category term="mathematics,"/><category term="algebra,"/><category term="graphs"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Formalizing compositions of n-ary relations to generate algebras from hypergraphs, recovering classical path algebras and producing new associative and non-associative structures.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Algoritmo QR Trasladado</title><link href="https://sergioqs.github.io/blog/2025/QRtrasladado/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Algoritmo QR Trasladado"/><published>2025-08-22T15:12:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-08-22T15:12:00+00:00</updated><id>https://sergioqs.github.io/blog/2025/QRtrasladado</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://sergioqs.github.io/blog/2025/QRtrasladado/"><![CDATA[<div class="embedded-notebook"> <div class="jupyter-notebook" style="position: relative; width: 100%; margin: 0 auto;"> <div class="jupyter-notebook-iframe-container"> <iframe src="/assets/jupyter/QRTrasladado.ipynb.html" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; border-style: none;" width="100%" height="100%" onload="this.parentElement.style.paddingBottom = (this.contentWindow.document.documentElement.scrollHeight + 10) + 'px'"></iframe> </div> </div> </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="mathematics"/><category term="applied_math,"/><category term="numerical_analysis,"/><category term="factorization,"/><category term="julia"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Implementación y análisis del algoritmo de factorización QR 